# CAR TOOLS environment configuration
#
# The default weather provider (Open-Meteo) requires NO API key and works out of the box.
# This variable is reserved for swapping to a keyed provider in the future.
# NOTE: VITE_ prefixed variables are embedded into the client build, so treat them as
# public, not secret. Never put a private server secret here.
VITE_WEATHER_API_KEY=
